{"format_version":"vbulletin-3+-thread","url":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/off-topic/1141547-new-with-a-wta-question","id":1141547,"title":"New with a WtA question","path":["Home","Onyx Path","Additional Discussion","Off-Topic"],"posts":[{"date":"2017-09-18T14:46:12-07:00","id":1141547,"title":"<img src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/icons/icon5.png\" width=\"16\" height=\"16\" alt=\"\" /> New with a WtA question","content":"I am new to these forums and this may have been answered before, I apologize if it has. Has there been any announcement by Onyx to re-release Werewolf the Apocalypse like they are doing with Vampire the Masquerade? I would love to be able to utilize the storytellers vault for WtA. like you can for Vampire. Werewolf: The Forsaken is NOT the same, please tell me that WtA is being revived!","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/17121-aedales","name":"Aedales","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar17121_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Sep 2017"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-09-18T15:01:47-07:00","id":1141553,"title":"","content":"Onyx Path has released the 20th anniversary edition of WtA as they did with VtM under license from White Wolf.<br /> <br /> Vampire 5th edition (and the Storyteller's Vault) are products of White Wolf Publishing directly. They have not announced a 5th edition of WtA as of yet. They did announce a WtA video game being developed by Cyanide though.<br /> <br />","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>(he/him/his)<br /> <br /> <a href=\"http://www.kickstarter.com/projects/200664283/demon-the-descent-prestige-edition\" target=\"_blank\"><img itemprop=\"image\" class=\"bbcode-attachment\" src=\"http://img513.imageshack.us/img513/4478/8vno.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" /></a><br /> Backer #2010","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1329-elvesofzion","name":"ElvesofZion","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1329_2.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1086"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-09-19T06:39:31-07:00","id":1141726,"title":"","content":"There's also WtA content on <a href=\"https://www.worldofdarkness.com\" target=\"_blank\">www.worldofdarkness.com</a>. It's all lore stuff right now, but I imagine that it's leading into White Wolf making a W5. Technically Onyx Path isn't making a new Vampire edition, but they <i>did</i> already make 20th Anniversary editions of both Vampire and Werewolf (and you just missed grabbing the W20 bundle on bundleofholding.com).","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>&quot;<a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/werewolf-the-forsaken/127887-doing-first-tongue-translations?p=484226#post484226\" target=\"_blank\">Nihhina kalekal-zidu kal masun, kal manudanadu. Nihhina kalekal-zidu nukal shaghu-desasudu \u2014 nihhina kalekal-zidu kal innu-desasudu udhkal samm</a>.&quot; Arthur Ashe<br /> She/her, contributing writer for <a href=\"https://www.drivethrurpg.com/product/363404/Scion-Pride-2021\" target=\"_blank\">Scion: Pride 2021</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1923-bigdamnhero","name":"BigDamnHero","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1923_4.jpg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jan 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1263"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-09-19T19:19:03-07:00","id":1141993,"title":"","content":"Just an important note: the WtA material (and VtM for that matter) on worldofdarkness.com is from the By Night Studios LARP books. There's a lot of things that could be confusing if you don't know that this is the case, as that website is starting with the BNS LARP material and building from there.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/617-heavy-arms","name":"Heavy Arms","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar617_2.jpeg","title":"Banned","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"12634"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-09-19T20:25:02-07:00","id":1142018,"title":"","content":"As ElvesofZion said, it hasn't been announced officially, they're still working on Vampire fifth edition.<br /> <br /> But it stands to reason they're going to bull ahead with Apocalypse afterwards, and Mage after that.<br /> <br /> I wouldn't expect it for a few years, though.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/886-nofather","name":"nofather","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar886_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"11016"}]},"thankedby":[]}]}